.vitepress/cache
# Compiled output emitted beside a source file by a composite build. A stale emitted `.js` is
# resolved by Node, tsx, vitest and ESLint in preference to the `.ts` beside it, so the code that
# runs is not the code on disk. These patterns keep it out of `git status`; `no-stale-build-artifacts`
# (tools/governance/src/rules/, evidence from governance-context.ts's presentToolingFiles()) is what
# NAMES one that exists.
#
# This block is WIDER than presentToolingFiles()'s guard census, not identical to it — the two lists
# are not claimed to be the same list. The guard scans every tools/*/src (discovered, never
# hardcoded) plus layers/core-ui/__scripts__ and __e2e__ (the two in-package homes AU37 gave tools
# that moved into the package they serve; hardcoded here and in the guard because there are exactly
# two and they do not grow the way tools/* packages do — a third in-package destination is a decision
# this file and the guard should both be updated for on review, not something a scan should paper
# over). The layers/*, framework/*, applications/* map-only lines below cover a DIFFERENT, older
# hazard (AU26 C3 — a bare `tsc -p` against a stale dist/ emitting declaration maps straight into a
# package's own src/) that the stale-build-artifact guard's census does not cover and this work
# package does not change.
#
# All four suffixes under the tooling and relocated-tool source dirs: every file there is a .ts
# source and none has a hand-written declaration (verified). Under the shipping roots' src/ only the
# MAPS, because `vite-env.d.ts`, `window.d.ts` and `css-modules.d.ts` are real sources.
tools/*/src/**/*.js
tools/*/src/**/*.js.map
tools/*/src/**/*.d.ts
tools/*/src/**/*.d.ts.map
layers/core-ui/__scripts__/**/*.js
layers/core-ui/__scripts__/**/*.js.map
layers/core-ui/__scripts__/**/*.d.ts
layers/core-ui/__scripts__/**/*.d.ts.map
layers/core-ui/__e2e__/**/*.js
layers/core-ui/__e2e__/**/*.js.map
layers/core-ui/__e2e__/**/*.d.ts
layers/core-ui/__e2e__/**/*.d.ts.map
layers/*/src/**/*.d.ts.map
layers/*/src/**/*.js.map
layers/*/*/src/**/*.d.ts.map
layers/*/*/src/**/*.js.map
framework/*/src/**/*.d.ts.map
framework/*/src/**/*.js.map
applications/*/src/**/*.d.ts.map
applications/*/src/**/*.js.map
framework/db/src/*.d.ts
# viewer compiled outputs (Vite resolves ./discovery.js → discovery.ts at build/dev time;
# emitted .js/.d.ts/.map files must not be committed)
framework/design-system/viewer/*.js
framework/design-system/viewer/*.d.ts
framework/design-system/viewer/*.js.map
framework/design-system/viewer/*.d.ts.map
# AJ7: same for the annotations/ subdir (the inspector modules)
framework/design-system/viewer/**/*.js
framework/design-system/viewer/**/*.d.ts
framework/design-system/viewer/**/*.js.map
framework/design-system/viewer/**/*.d.ts.map

